{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2023-02-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION EXECUTIVES TO ADDRESS THE BARCLAYS 2023 INDUSTRIAL SELECT CONFERENCE', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB. , FEB. 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JENNIFER HAMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AND KENNY ROCKER, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT – MARKETING AND SALES, OF UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: UNP) WILL ADDRESS THE BARCLAYS 2023 INDUSTRIAL SELECT CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, FEB. 22, 2023, AT 8:35 A.M.'}